{"id":"vod_sn_37674","vodId":"37674","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"虹色时光","name_cn":"虹色时光","date":"2016-01-01","year":"2016","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/855b14eedff6f501efa1fcbcd627c721.jpg"},"summary":"故事发生在洋溢着青春气息的高中校园之内，活泼善良喜欢妄想的纯情少年羽柴夏树（松冈祯丞 配音）、英俊帅气轻浮自恋的万人迷松勇智也（江口拓也 配音）、外表随和内心腹黑的抖S片仓惠一（岛崎信长 配音）、沉默寡言拥有超高智商的学霸直江刚（内山昂辉 配音），他们共同生活学习在同一个班级之中，彼此之间形影不离，感情十分要好。　　某日，夏树在校园之中邂逅了名为小早川杏奈（藤田奈央 配音）的可爱少女，让他没有想到的是，杏奈竟然就是那个在他最落魄的圣诞之夜里给予过他安慰的陌生人。随着时间的推移，夏树和杏奈之间渐渐产生了朦胧的感情，然而，两人最大的阻碍竟然来自于杏奈的闺蜜筒井茉莉（内山夕实 配音）。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:54:30","playable":true,"episodeCount":24,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/SFu2KNkpSE1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/u6E39rWtD71/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/5K6nuixnPD1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/gQtSz7JAWu1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/hQrkq7kT9k1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/sbzG1brAGh1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/V5b8Mtr7R51/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/EsF3gJagy21/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/JJJSUwmvdx1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Sx3x46mszm1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/4ac44PnjCc1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/kGHX7XuMTY1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/BxyGTQrZFq1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/HytmHRsZgB1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"